              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear and light armour. May have shield +2 and a composite bow +3. Rides in a chariot bought at an additional cost from this list. Any units within 12" of the Vassal King, who are of the same nationality as him, may use his Leadership when it takes a Leadership test. (Chariot Wars p.29)</characteristic>
