              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and light armour. May have shield +2. Rides in a chariot bought at an additional cost from this list. Army Standard. 0-1. (Chariot Wars p.29)</characteristic>
